2. **Local clone:** `git clone https://github.com/your-username/endpoint-management-platform.git`
3. **Install:** `cd endpoint-management-platform && npm install`
4. **Configure:** `cp .env.example .env` and edit with your values
5. **Deploy:** `docker-compose up -d`
6. **Test:** `npm test` to run the test suite

